{"unit_id":"Win-Hao__seek-on-dsh#card-card-zh","repo":"Win-Hao/seek-on-dsh","commit":"edc05743c1bf3e43509f282c12310d27cd2471d3","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"Seek 是一款面向 DSH Web 的像素鲸鱼桌宠，会浮在界面角落并根据会话快照改变动画。它接入 shell.overlay 插槽，将等待权限、等待提问、计划审阅、单会话运行、多会话运行和已完成等状态映射为不同姿势；空闲时也会阅读、喝咖啡或打盹。用户可以拖动鲸鱼、点击互动，或用 Alt 点击逐个预览状态；位置保存在浏览器本地。适合希望直观看到 DSH 会话进度并为网页界面添加轻量装饰的用户。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client.js:70-83"]}
{"unit_id":"Win-Hao__seek-on-dsh#card-card-en","repo":"Win-Hao/seek-on-dsh","commit":"edc05743c1bf3e43509f282c12310d27cd2471d3","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"Seek is a pixel whale pet for DSH Web. In shell.overlay, it reflects approvals, questions, reviews, running or completed sessions, and idle time through distinct animations. Users can drag or poke it, Alt-click to preview poses, and its position is saved locally.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client.js:70-83"]}
