{"unit_id":"Win-Hao__seek-on-dsh#feature-1","repo":"Win-Hao/seek-on-dsh","commit":"edc05743c1bf3e43509f282c12310d27cd2471d3","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Seek 的功能「会话状态动画」：它读取会话快照，将审批、提问、计划审阅、运行中、并行运行、完成和空闲映射为鲸鱼姿势。动画自动随窗口内会话状态更新。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client.js:70-83"]}
{"unit_id":"Win-Hao__seek-on-dsh#feature-2","repo":"Win-Hao/seek-on-dsh","commit":"edc05743c1bf3e43509f282c12310d27cd2471d3","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Seek 的功能「拖动与记忆位置」：用户可抓住鲸鱼拖到网页窗口内其他位置；松开后把右侧和底部偏移写入 localStorage，下次打开时恢复。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client.js:85-91"]}
{"unit_id":"Win-Hao__seek-on-dsh#feature-3","repo":"Win-Hao/seek-on-dsh","commit":"edc05743c1bf3e43509f282c12310d27cd2471d3","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Seek 的功能「互动和状态预览」：点击鲸鱼会触发惊讶姿势，短时间连续点击会升级为恼火；Alt 点击则逐个固定预览动画状态，再回到实时状态。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client.js:125-151"]}
